      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F884E2D610FFF01000A4F6053EF4EE54F5C4E3A621176848DDF73ED52A05165950886807EC4300200100001BE00000A8FD94E484E006765FF0C4F604E5F5C316CA1529E6CD5505A574F4E8B54AFFF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过啊，既然要加入锈蚀组，\n至少得会用钢属性或毒属性的招式吧？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不然还怎么耍帅啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7554AFF0C65E27136898152A05165950886807EC4FF0C000A81F35C115F974F1A752894A25C5E602762166BD25C5E6027768462DB5F0F5427FF1F00100001BE00000A4E0D71368FD8600E4E48800D5E05554AFF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好嘞！咱们这就去找个\n毒击的招式学习器之类的呗。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我就算是来硬的，也要让你学会。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
